flowchart TD
  Start([Receive order]) --> Check{Stock available?}
  Check -->|yes| Pack[Pack the parcel<br>and print the label]
  Check -->|no| Backorder[Place a backorder with the supplier, then notify the customer by email]
  Pack --> Ship[(Shipping database)]
  Backorder --> Ship
  Ship --> Done((Delivered))
  classDef warm fill:#ffe8cc,stroke:#d9480f,stroke-width:3px,color:#862e00
  class Backorder warm
  style Done fill:#d3f9d8,stroke:#2b8a3e,stroke-width:2px
